@startuml client_connection_send_activity
title ClientConnection - sending without a reply

start
:Send(message);
:sends_.Send(message);
:Return the helper result unchanged;
stop

legend
    ClientSendQueue owns size checks, admission, sequencing, and transport.
    The facade does not acquire the send mutex or inspect reply reservations.
    The caption links to the helper activity rather than duplicating it.
endlegend

@enduml